            "state": "translated",
            "value": "警告"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When off, Finder no longer stays in the taskbar: once every Finder window is closed, it disappears from the taskbar like any other app. Clicking a windowless Finder card to open your home folder is disabled as well.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When off, Finder no longer stays in the taskbar: once every Finder window is closed, it disappears from the taskbar like any other app. Clicking a windowless Finder card to open your home folder is disabled as well."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关闭后，访达不再常驻任务条：没有打开任何访达窗口时，它会和普通应用一样从任务条上消失。\n点击无窗口的访达卡打开个人文件夹的行为也会一并取消。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When off, moving the pointer across the taskbar no longer shows app names.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When off, moving the pointer across the taskbar no longer shows app names."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关闭后，鼠标划过任务条不再有放大和名称提示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You’re Already Subscribed": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You’re Already Subscribed"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你已经订阅过了"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You’re subscribed. When licensing arrives, it will be sent straight to your inbox.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You’re subscribed. When licensing arrives, it will be sent straight to your inbox."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已订阅。将来的授权会直接发送到你的邮箱。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS ties Accessibility permission to one specific copy of an app. This copy is running from a temporary or read-only location, so turning the switch on will not take effect — and the permission record stays behind in System Settings after the disk image is ejected. Drag Tungsten Edge to your Applications folder and open it from there.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS ties Accessibility permission to one specific copy of an app. This copy is running from a temporary or read-only location, so turning the switch on will not take effect — and the permission record stays behind in System Settings after the disk image is ejected. Drag Tungsten Edge to your Applications folder and open it from there."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 会把辅助功能授权绑定到具体的应用副本上。当前这份钨极跑在一个临时或只读的位置，就算你打开了开关也不会生效，而且卸载磁盘映像后那条授权记录还会留在系统里。请把 Tungsten Edge 拖到“应用程序”文件夹，再从那里重新打开。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "you@example.com": {
      "comment": "邮箱输入框的占位示例，两种语言相同",
      "localizations": {
